@base = http://localhost:3000

### Prometheus metrics (text exposition format)
GET {{base}}/metrics

### Request continuing an existing trace (W3C Trace Context) – find it in Jaeger by trace id
GET {{base}}/api/v1/rooms
traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01

### Generates a 404 -> api_problems_total{type="not-found"}
GET {{base}}/api/v1/rooms/0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-00000000ffff

### Jaeger API – the trace above
GET http://localhost:16686/api/traces/4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736

### Prometheus query API – request rate per path
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/query?query=sum%20by%20(path)%20(rate(http_requests_total%5B1m%5D))
